type: software
title: OpenCausalLab
version: "0.1.0-python-replication"
date-released: "2026-08-05"
abstract: >-
  A framework for independently verifying empirical economics research through
  transparent Python implementations. The first case study reproduces the
  published empirical design of Lakdawala, Martínez Heredia, and Vera-Cossio
  (Effects of Expanding Worker Rights to Children) without breaking identification.
